# Ignore file of DbAgentNext/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# The build context is the repository root: send DbAgentNext/ and Shared/ only, and of DbAgentNext/ only what
# the production build reads.
*
!DbAgentNext
!Shared

**/node_modules
**/*.md
DbAgentNext/dist
DbAgentNext/docs
DbAgentNext/test-e2e
DbAgentNext/test-parity
DbAgentNext/**/*.spec.ts
DbAgentNext/.env*
